            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's New in 0.13.4</h2><ul><li>Resume caption wrapping from the previous line breaks</li><li>Parse speaker paragraphs once per diarized view update</li><li>Show live dictation text in an NSTextView that edits only the tail</li><li>Throttle partial results once, and wait only the remaining interval</li><li>Deliver streaming results in the order providers receive them</li></ul>]]></description>
